  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello!\n\nI play VRChat without using my voice.\n\nInstead, I communicate using emojis, gestures, and typing.\n\nBut when I try to select an emoji while doing gestures, I sometimes accidentally \"misclick\" and throw out the wrong emoji right next to it, which is a bit frustrating...\n\nI'm sure I'm not the only one who has experienced this.\n\nHave you ever accidentally thrown out the wrong emoji while hyping up a music event or chatting, or seen someone else do it?\n\nPlease let us hide (or remove) emojis we don't use from the Default Emoji Menu, just like we can with the Custom Menu!\n\nOr, please allow us to add default emojis directly to our Custom Menu!!!\n\n(I know we could upload the same images ourselves to use in the Custom slots, but even with VRC+, the number of emoji slots is limited, so that workaround isn't ideal...)\n\nIf this becomes possible, it will reduce accidental misclicks and make a lot of people happy. Plus, it would be a massive help for players like me who communicate without speaking.\n\nThank you so much for considering this!",
